---
/**
 * The site's 404 page. Starlight's built-in route reads a `404` docs entry and
 * warns when it is missing; a custom page avoids both that warning and a
 * duplicate route for the entry. It is shown for every missing URL, including
 * Japanese ones, so it carries both languages.
 */
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<StarlightPage
  frontmatter={{ title: 'Page not found', template: 'splash', editUrl: false, pagefind: false }}
  hasSidebar={false}
>
  <p>
    This page does not exist. Check the address or use the search bar to find a page. You can also
    go to the <a href={`${base}/`}>Overview</a> or the <a href={`${base}/quick-start/`}>Quick start</a>.
  </p>
  <p lang="ja">
    このページは存在しません。URL を確認するか、検索バーから探してください。<a href={`${base}/ja/`}>概要</a>や<a
      href={`${base}/ja/quick-start/`}>クイックスタート</a
    >にも戻れます。
  </p>
</StarlightPage>
